# Kaggle API Credentials (for downloading dataset automatically via Kaggle CLI)
# 
# Instructions to get KAGGLE_API_TOKEN:
# 1. Log in to Kaggle (https://www.kaggle.com)
# 2. Go to Settings page (https://www.kaggle.com/settings)
# 3. Scroll to API section and click "Create New Token"
# 4. Copy the generated API Token (or value inside KAGGLE_API_TOKEN instruction) and paste below:
KAGGLE_API_TOKEN=your_kaggle_api_token_here
